  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Compound verb: {塗|ぬ}る + {替|か}える.\n\nPATTERN: Xを{塗|ぬ}り{替|か}える (repaint X / rewrite X)\n\nCOMPOUND VERB PATTERN: ～{替|か}える compounds indicate replacing or redoing:\n・{書|か}き{替|か}える (to rewrite)\n・{作|つく}り{替|か}える (to remake)\n・{入|い}れ{替|か}える (to replace)\n\nFIGURATIVE USE: Very common in sports journalism when describing record-breaking achievements.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n・{記録|きろく}を{塗|ぬ}り{替|か}える (break a record)\n・{歴史|れきし}を{塗|ぬ}り{替|か}える (rewrite history)",
